Package: xray-gateway-core
Version: @COREVER@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Boris Kaganovich <bkaganovich@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: xray-core binary for xray-gateway
 The upstream xray-core proxy binary, installed at /opt/xray-proxy/bin/xray
 where xray-gateway expects it. Packaged separately so that the core can be
 updated independently of the gateway application.
